GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Article 21 does not say what follows when the cash value covers a period's premium but, less the Debt, does not cover the shortfall` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 21 does not say what follows when the cash value covers a period's premium but, less the Debt, does not cover the shortfall"

GIVEN p IS A `The position at the end of a grace period`
GIVETH A `The outcome at the end of a grace period`
`21 — the outcome of` p MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF p's `a premium received during the grace period`       THEN `the premium was paid`
        IF p's `the policyholder asked to terminate the contract` THEN `Article 21 does not apply: the policyholder asked to terminate`
        IF `held` AT LEAST `premium`                              THEN `the premium is paid from the coupons, dividends and interest held`
        IF `available` LESS THAN p's `premium for one month`      THEN `the contract lapses at the end of the grace period`
        IF p's `cash value` LESS THAN `premium`                   THEN `the premium frequency is shortened, at most to monthly, and the premium advanced`
        IF `available` AT LEAST `premium` MINUS `held`            THEN `the shortfall is advanced from the cash value as an automatic premium loan` (`premium` MINUS `held`)
        OTHERWISE `Article 21 does not say what follows when the cash value covers a period's premium but, less the Debt, does not cover the shortfall`
    WHERE
        `premium`   MEANS p's `premium for one period at the current frequency`
        `held`      MEANS p's `comfort cash coupons, dividends and interest held`
        `available` MEANS p's `cash value` MINUS p's `the debt`

-- 21.3: while the contract has lapsed, no benefit is paid (cstd-ch2-benefits.l4 asks
-- whether the contract was in force at the event).
-- src:1108-1109, quoted above.

§§ `Article 22 — Deductions`
-- src:1111 | ĐIỀU 22  KHẤU TRỪ

-- 22.1: premiums falling due before the Company approves a claim must be paid before any
-- benefit is. 22.2: before paying, the Company may set off the Debt, and on a death the
-- funeral benefit advanced; it does not ask for the shortfall if the payment is not enough.
