-- src:1124 | toán số tiền còn thiếu nếu (các) quyền lợi bảo hiểm
-- src:1125 | hoặc khoản tiền nào khác mà Công Ty chấp thuận chi
-- src:1126 | trả không đủ để khấu trừ các khoản nêu trên.
GIVEN `benefit`                     IS A NUMBER
      `premiums due before approval` IS A NUMBER
      `debt`                         IS A NUMBER
      `funeral benefit advanced`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`22 — the payment of` `benefit` `after` `premiums due before approval` `,` `debt` `and` `funeral benefit advanced` MEANS
    max 0 (`benefit` MINUS `premiums due before approval` MINUS `debt` MINUS `funeral benefit advanced`)

§§ `Article 23 — Reinstatement`
-- src:1128 | ĐIỀU 23  KHÔI PHỤC HIỆU LỰC HỢP ĐỒNG

-- The policyholder may ask for reinstatement within two years of the lapse, and not later
-- than the maturity date, if (a) the request is in writing as the Company requires, (b) the
-- contract has not been terminated early for its surrender value, (c) the Company accepts
-- the evidence of insurability, and (d) the overdue premiums to the approval date, and the
-- unpaid Debt with interest at the published rate, are paid. The reinstatement date is on the
-- endorsement.
