GIVEN c       IS A `The contract`
      request IS A DATE
      lapse   IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`23 — under` c `a request on` request `after a lapse on` lapse `is in time` MEANS
        request AT MOST `add years` lapse 2
    AND request AT MOST `the maturity date of` c

DECLARE `A request for reinstatement` HAS
    `in writing, as the Company requires`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `not terminated early for the surrender value`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of insurability accepted by the Company`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `overdue premiums, unpaid Debt and interest paid`         IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN c       IS A `The contract`
      lapse   IS A DATE
      request IS A DATE
      r       IS A `A request for reinstatement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`23 — under` c `after a lapse on` lapse `the request of` request `meets Article 23:` r MEANS
        `23 — under` c `a request on` request `after a lapse on` lapse `is in time`
    AND r's `in writing, as the Company requires`
    AND r's `not terminated early for the surrender value`
    AND r's `evidence of insurability accepted by the Company`
    AND r's `overdue premiums, unpaid Debt and interest paid`

-- The right, on a clock of days from the lapse: open for the days to the earlier of two years
-- after the lapse and the maturity date.
GIVEN c     IS A `The contract`
      lapse IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the contract`
`23 — under` c `the right to request reinstatement after a lapse on` lapse MEANS
    PARTY `the Policyholder`
    MAY   `request reinstatement in writing`
    WITHIN (min (Day (`add years` lapse 2)) (Day (`the maturity date of` c)) MINUS Day lapse)

§§ `Article 24 — The cash value table`
-- src:1153 | ĐIỀU 24  BẢNG GIÁ TRỊ TIỀN MẶT

-- The contract has a cash value from the payment of the first premium of the second policy
-- year, provided premiums are paid when due and the contract is in force. The schedule shows
-- the guaranteed cash value and reduced paid-up sum insured at each policy year end; between
-- year ends the Company's method applies (not stated, so not computed); the 1.15 halving
-- applies after a late-stage approval.
