      request IS A DATE
      `offered`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `qualifies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `premiums paid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`28.2 — under` c `a request on` request `to add a rider, offered` `offered` `, the person qualifying` `qualifies` `, premiums paid` `premiums paid` `, may be granted` MEANS
        request LESS THAN `add months` (c's `effective date`) 6
